WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_21h.avi
Scene: Approaching the Lunatic Pandora for the assault
Duration: approximately 14 seconds
Describes the dangerous approach toward the massive crystal structure as enemy forces attempt to intercept.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The Ragnarok streaks toward the hovering Lunatic Pandora. The crystal structure dominates the viewport — hundreds of meters of jagged, glowing purple-blue stone.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Galbadian interceptor craft emerge from clouds below. Red tracer fire streams across the sky — laser weapons designed to bring down the Ragnarok.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The Ragnarok banks hard to starboard, weaving between incoming fire. Squall's piloting is expert and decisive. Each dodge is calculated perfectly.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The Lunatic Pandora grows larger as the Ragnarok approaches at high speed. Its immensity becomes more apparent with every meter of distance closed. This is not a structure meant to be penetrated. But the team has no choice. Seifer awaits inside.